{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e17-scene-08",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "闺女原来是一只猫  (His Daughter Is Actually a Cat)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Before heading back to the office, Xingzi puts Bu Xiaogu in charge of looking after Chun Yuqiao and sends over videos of the five-year-old overseas daughter Kaiwen mentioned earlier. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "工作上就这么几个事，后面你就负责把老大照顾好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "公司的人谁都别理，什么杂事都别管，知道吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，我记住了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "对了，那边发了几段视频到我手机上，我转给你，回头给老大看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "就是淳于总那个五岁、在国外生活的闺女吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "对啊，要不我先给你看看也行，反正早晚得见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么？他闺女居然是一只猫啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "是啊，你看它长得跟老大像吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "仔细看看，还真有一点像！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "快去给老大看他闺女的视频吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "拿过来给我看看吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "工作上就这么几个事，后面你就负责把老大照顾好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Those are the only work items; from here on, your job is taking good care of the boss.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "公司的人谁都别理，什么杂事都别管，知道吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ignore everyone from the office and tune out all other chores, got it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，我记住了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay, I will remember.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "对了，那边发了几段视频到我手机上，我转给你，回头给老大看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'By the way, they sent over a few video clips; I will forward them to your phone to show the boss later.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "就是淳于总那个五岁、在国外生活的闺女吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You mean Chun Yuqiao's five-year-old daughter living abroad?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "对啊，要不我先给你看看也行，反正早晚得见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is right—or I can show you first right now since you will meet her sooner or later.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么？他闺女居然是一只猫啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What? His daughter is actually a cat!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "是啊，你看它长得跟老大像吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yep—do you not think she looks just like the boss?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "仔细看看，还真有一点像！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Looking closely, there really is a bit of a resemblance!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "快去给老大看他闺女的视频吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry in and show the boss the videos of his kitty.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "拿过来给我看看吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bring it over and let me have a look.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "工作上就这么几个事，后面你就负责把老大照顾好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "公司的人谁都别理，什么杂事都别管，知道吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
